Śatrughna leaves ministers and rides to Ayōdhyā --- Śatrughna enters city and bows to Rāma --- Śatrughna reports Lavaṇa slain and city settled --- Śatrughna pleads he cannot live apart from Rāma --- Rāma embraces him and forbids kṣatriya grief --- Rāma bids him guard kingdom and visit often --- Śatrughna stays five nights and returns escorted